CC   IMGT/LIGM-DB annotation level: by annotators
CC   
CC   [1] reports that the human C-gamma-4 gene is equally homologous to
CC   the mouse gamma-1, gamma-2a, and gamma-2b genes (about 75%). [3]
CC   also reports partial sequences for human gamma-2, gamma-3, and a
CC   gamma pseudogene. [2] presents the gamma-1, gamma-2, gamma-3, and
CC   pseudo-gamma hinge regions.
CC   This entry is part of a multigene region (region B), which includes
CC   the gamma-2, gamma-4, epsilon-1, and alpha-2 genes. See segment 1
CC   for more comments.
CC   Complete source information:
CC   Human fetal liver DNA, library of T. Maniatis [3] and Lawn et al
CC   [1],[2]; clones 24B [1], lambda-HG4.1 [3], and Ig-gamma-4-2 [2].
